  2751	## 性能与容量摘要
  2752	
  2753	| 操作 | 单次成本 | 累积成本 | 首个预算 | 验证 |
  2754	|---|---|---|---|---|
  2755	| terminal observe | O(1) indexed upsert | 每 Task/Intent 一行 job | P95 <10 ms | job benchmark |
  2756	| Task source resolve | O(相关对象数) | 不持久化 raw window | ≤256 objects、≤2 MiB redacted bytes | source bounded test |
  2757	| Intent compile input | O(贡献 Task summaries) | 一条 Intent revision | Task 数有硬上限，超出分层/omission | intent scale fixture |
  2758	| Writer | O(new objects + projection rows) | 每 source generation 一 revision | CAS retry ≤3；对象/row 增量有固定上限 | writer probe |
  2759	| Incremental projection | O(new events) | 投影与权威历史线性增长 | batch size 有界 | projection benchmark |
  2760	| Full rebuild | O(all Memory objects) | 无额外权威数据 | 10k Episodes P95 ≤30 s | ignored stable-runner test |
  2761	| Search | FTS O(match postings) + candidate ancestry | FTS external-content index | 10k Episodes P95≤50 ms/P99≤100 ms | memory benchmark |
  2762	| Retrieval quality | 固定 query/gold 集上的 Top K 排序 | 随 corpus version/selector version 显式更新 | Recall@10≥0.80；NDCG@10≥0.70 | deterministic benchmark + baseline validator |
  2763	| Injection + receipt | O(Top K + token accounting + indexed prune) | receipt 每次请求一行，30 天且每仓最多 10,000 行 | 本地 P95≤20 ms，不含 search/provider | injection/retention benchmark |
  2764	| SQLite size | search doc + FTS + indexes | 与 redacted summary 线性 | index bytes≤2.5× search-doc bytes | size report |
