  2763	| Injection + receipt | O(Top K + token accounting + indexed prune) | receipt 每次请求一行，30 天且每仓最多 10,000 行 | 本地 P95≤20 ms，不含 search/provider | injection/retention benchmark |
  2764	| SQLite size | search doc + FTS + indexes | 与 redacted summary 线性 | index bytes≤2.5× search-doc bytes | size report |
